  "details": "The gesture lock under config is accessable in desktop as well as on vive(wands) and other non index controllers. However it doesn't actually prevent the user from doing gestures on these platforms/controllers.\n\nThere is 2 ways you can expect the behaviour to be:\n1. gray out the toggle when not using an index controller (or other controller with finger tracking)\n2. Or make the gesture lock actually stop gestures on all platforms (including on desktop)\n\nCurrent behaviour:\nGesture lock is available no matter what controller is being used, including desktop mode keyboard and mice, It does not prevent gestures from being used on any controll scheme besides index controllers.",
